望します！\n(背景もくま感があったらうれしいです！)\n\n描写範囲は全身で、縦構図を希望します。\n全身が見切れないように描いて頂けないでしょうか？\n納品の際、人物・背景をレイヤー分けしてpsdファイルやPNGで納品頂けたら幸いです。\n料金不足ございましたら、再送要請にてお知らせ下さい。\n\nぜひまたご縁がありますように...！！\nお返事が来ることをお待ちしております。\nどうぞよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maroyaka_8/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bf9e6b8/uploads/origins/bd5e8b0b-1574-4b5b-8fd3-e252d90fc65f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d018c7376f725ce4af347a970aea1e5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2bf9e6b8/uploads/origins/bd5e8b0b-1574-4b5b-8fd3-e252d90fc65f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d018c7376f725ce4af347a970aea1e5, https://si.imgix.net/2bf9e6b8/uploads/origins/bd5e8b0b-1574-4b5b-8fd3-e252d90fc65f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47f607181641fb2daf658605ffed2c80 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2bf9e6b8/uploads/origins/bd5e8b0b-1574-4b5b-8fd3-e252d90fc65f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b6b654753c12b91e0051a0d23bb6ad0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art. The girls you draw are so beautiful, like dolls. If it is OK, I would like to request an illustration of my orichara Mira.\n\nMira is a sweet, gentle girl, but she is also socially awkward and cowardly. She tends to overthink things, and be hysterical. Still, she always does her best. Even when she suffers, she does not give up. Though she may seem weak-hearted, she is actually a strong girl who desperately wants to live happily.\n\nShe likes to garden. She feels like her existence is a good thing when she makes something grow and stay alive.\n\nMOTIF: small blue flowers, bicycle, white cat, looking out the window, nature, cooking\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XPsj3SXJ4KT1SWHz_htiNXcwkTmxqom8?usp=drive_link \nPlease note the tattoo on her back and neck. I would like if her hair was in a ponytail with her black ribbon. A dress would be cute, but any outfit is OK! Draw whatever you like!\n\nThank you so much for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maroyaka_8/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4107a1f/uploads/origins/08a9929b-3984-45d6-be7a-764cb370b88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31aad4391fa306e46821aa5ecfe8c7b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4107a1f/uploads/origins/08a9929b-3984-45d6-be7a-764cb370b88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31aad4391fa306e46821aa5ecfe8c7b5, https://si.imgix.net/e4107a1f/uploads/origins/08a9929b-3984-45d6-be7a-764cb370b88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=032d6c3b873e9fbb1714cce4ed0ef8f6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4107a1f/uploads/origins/08a9929b-3984-45d6-be7a-764cb370b88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=28e1bd9630babf930512c677df10b31e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maroyaka_8/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/74d88ec9/uploads/origins/09af2edd-fbd8-497f-8f43-59ba24d290e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de0515a7247b351a4a86fc7e13062d59", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74d88ec9/uploads/origins/09af2edd-fbd8-497f-8f43-59ba24d290e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de0515a7247b351a4a86fc7e13062d59, https://si.imgix.net/74d88ec9/uploads/origins/09af2edd-fbd8-497f-8f43-59ba24d